<title>MEXICO: TABLE - Telecom 1997 six-month results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Telecom 1997 six-month results.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1997			H1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		  854.29 million	     894.43 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 81.07 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income	81.07 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   290.19 million	     373.82</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos. The company said</p>
